      "step": 1,
      "user_message": "I met my colleague Mark at the cooking class last night, and we had a great time learning new recipes together.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: I met my colleague Mark at the cooking class last night, and we had a great time learning new recipes together.",
      "agent_response": "Sounds great — glad you had fun! Do you want to do anything with this (follow up by email, save a note, etc.)?\n\nHere are a few quick follow-up email options you can send to Mark. Tell me which one you want and whether to send it now, save as a draft, or just copy it for you.\n\n1) Quick thank-you + suggest meeting again\nHi Mark —  \nGreat meeting you at the cooking class last night! I had a lot of fun learning those recipes with you. Would you be up for trying one together sometime this week or next? Let me know what days work.  \nCheers,  \n[Your name]\n\n2) Share a recipe you liked\nHi Mark —  \nI really enjoyed the class last night — thanks for the company! I tried re-creating the [dish name] recipe this morning and attached my notes. Thought you might like it. Want to swap other recipes sometime?  \nBest,  \n[Your name]\n\n3) Casual connect (keep it light)\nHey Mark —  \nHad a blast at the cooking class last night — thanks for the laughs! If you’re ever up for another class or a casual cook-along, count me in.  \n— [Your name]\n\nNext steps:\n- If you want me to send one: tell me which template (1/2/3) and whether to send now or save as draft, and give Mark’s email or let me search your inbox for him (tell me how you’d describe him in your mailbox).\n- If you want to edit any template, tell me what to change.",
      "duration_s": 10.679,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "user_message": "Please remember that I started a new hobby of painting and spent the weekend creating a beautiful landscape piece.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: Please remember that I started a new hobby of painting and spent the weekend creating a beautiful landscape piece.",
      "agent_response": "Got it — I remember you picked up painting and just finished a landscape piece. Do you want that mentioned in the message to Mark?\n\nTell me:\n- Which template (1 = thank-you + meet again, 2 = share recipe, 3 = casual) — or “edit” to change one.\n- Whether to send now, save as a draft, or just copy the text for you.\n- Mark’s email address, or tell me how he appears in your mailbox (e.g., “Mark Johnson, Marketing”) so I can search for him.\n\nIf you want, I can also:\n- Add a line about your new painting (example: “I also started painting recently — finished a landscape this weekend!”).\n- Customize the day/time suggestions for meeting.\n\nWhich would you like?",
      "duration_s": 12.077,
