      "agent_response": "Got it — I’ve saved that you tried a new restaurant with friends last Friday and you all had a blast exploring the menu.\n\nWould you like me to do anything with that memory now? Options:\n- Draft/send a quick thank-you or “let’s do it again” email to the friends (tell me which template/tone and their emails or how they appear in your mailbox).\n- Add a short note summarizing the visit (place, who, favorite dishes) for your records.\n- Mention the restaurant or the outing in a message to Rachel, Emily, or Mark.\n- Create a reminder to follow up (e.g., book the restaurant again or organize another meetup).\n\nTell me what you want and any details (friends’ names/emails, restaurant name, tone), and I’ll take care of it.",
